    - 3.96
    wordStarts: 000000000a000000130000001a0000001f00000025000000270000002a0000002c00000031000000
    wordLengths: 08000000080000000600000004000000050000000100000002000000010000000400000004000000
  - text: Broccoli. Broccoli is packed with vitamins A, C and K!
